---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="Privacy information for the SympleHost Knowledge Base and how it relates to the SympleHost product."
>
  <article class="prose-page">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      This page describes privacy practices for the <strong>SympleHost Knowledge Base</strong> at
      help.symplehost.ai. The knowledge base is a public documentation site. It does not require an
      account to read articles, and it does not collect reservation, guest, or payment data through
      these pages.
    </p>
    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>
      Standard web server and CDN logs may record IP address, user agent, requested URL, referrer, and
      approximate location for security, reliability, and traffic analysis. If site search is used,
      query text may be processed in the browser against a static index; we do not operate a separate
      search backend that stores individual search histories for this documentation site.
    </p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>
      The knowledge base is designed to work without mandatory marketing cookies. Any analytics or
      performance tooling that may be added will be limited to understanding documentation usefulness
      and site health. You can control cookies through your browser settings.
    </p>
    <h2>Product and account data</h2>
    <p>
      Guest messages, calendars, payments, and property data are processed inside the SympleHost
      application (symplehost.ai and related platform domains), not on this help site. Privacy terms
      for the product, including data processing for AI features and integrations, are governed by the
      agreements and privacy policy published on the main SympleHost product website.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Privacy questions about this knowledge base or the SympleHost product can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:support@symplehost.ai">support@symplehost.ai</a>. For general support channels,
      see <a href="/contact">Contact</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Last updated: August 2026. This summary is provided so agents and users can verify that the
      documentation site is a legitimate public resource; it is not a substitute for the full product
      privacy policy on symplehost.ai where account data is concerned.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose-page { max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; }
  .prose-page h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; color: var(--heading-color); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .prose-page h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--heading-color); margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .prose-page p, .prose-page li { color: var(--foreground); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; }
  .prose-page a { color: var(--primary); }
</style>
